{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9e8a7f1c-0001-4a00-9000-000000000001",
    "name": "ChubiPocket BE",
    "description": "Local-dev collection for the ChubiPocket Go backend.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import the matching environment file (`chubi-pocket-be.postman_environment.json`).\n2. Run **Auth → Register** (or **Login**) — the test script auto-populates `{{token}}` for every other request.\n3. Run **Accounts → Create (cash, no opening)** then **Accounts → Create (bank, with opening)** — populates `{{accountId}}` and `{{accountId2}}`.\n4. **Transactions → Create expense** populates `{{transactionId}}`. **Create transfer** populates `{{transferGroupId}}`.\n5. **Categories → Create** / **Tags → Create** populate their own ids.\n\nPhase coverage: Phase 0 (auth + users) + Phase 1a (categories, tags, accounts, transactions, transaction_tags).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
